          <g class="venn-circle-group" pointer-events="all" onclick="showOverlapInfo('hci-info','AI Threats and Defenses','Where AI and Cybersecurity meet: AI is both a security tool and a security threat. On the defense side, AI powers threat detection, anomaly identification, and automated response. On the offense side, AI enables more convincing phishing, deepfakes, voice cloning, and social engineering at a scale and quality that was previously impossible. Understanding this dual role is essential to understanding the risk landscape this research examines.')">
