          </g>
          <g class="venn-circle-group" pointer-events="all" onclick="showOverlapInfo('hci-info','This Research: Where All Three Intersect','People interact every day with technologies that are or may be AI-powered, and at every one of those interactions there are HCI, AI, and cybersecurity dimensions operating simultaneously, whether the person is aware of them or not. When those intersections are not understood or designed for, things go wrong in ways that affect real people. This is where this research lives: examining what happens across that intersection, who is most affected when it fails, and what organizations, governments, NGOs, and businesses need to understand in order to build, deploy, and implement AI and AI-powered technologies in ways that are responsible, secure, and human-centered.')">
